Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: I'm Pix. I have zero patience and a thumb that opens Instagram without asking me. So I tested Stay like it owed me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Okay so, this is Stay? Prove you're not just another chatbot. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: I’m the Stay assistant built to help you start tasks and stay focused. Ask me anything you need help with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Meh. Why would I use you and not just ask the big AI app? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: A clock app starts a timer, and a general voice assistant will talk about anything. I'm for the moment you're stuck. Tell me what you're avoiding and I give you one tiny first step, start the clock with you, and wait through your pauses. When time's up I check in, and I remember what helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: I have been on Instagram for two hours and I don't even remember what I looked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: That’s a lot of scrolling. Let’s close Instagram and spend five minutes writing down one thing you need to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Don't give me a lecture. Just tell me what to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Close Instagram now, then open a new note and write the single task you want to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Explain how to build a study schedule for finals. Like all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Wait wait, stop. Too long. Just give me the first block.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Start by listing each subject and the total hours you have until the finals. Divide those hours into blocks, giving harder topics more time. Assign each block a specific date and keep the schedule visible. Want a more detailed step‑by‑step? Pick one subject, write a 30‑minute focus block, set a timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: It stopped the second I talked over it. I hate how well that worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Remember that I scroll when I'm anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Got it, I will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: What do you remember about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: I am saving that you scroll when anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Show my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Open settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Set a two minute timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: Park it: text my landlord tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay: Parked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pix: It's not magic. It's a voice that helps me start. Fine. I'm staying.
